@startuml User_Journey_New_Student
!theme blueprint
title Cramer CMS - New Student Journey\n(Discovery to First Test Completion)

skinparam {
    BackgroundColor #1a1a2e
    TitleFontColor #ffffff
    TitleFontSize 18
    DefaultFontColor #e8e8e8
    ArrowColor #64b5f6
    NoteBackgroundColor #424242
    NoteFontColor #ffffff
    ActivityBackgroundColor #37474f
    ActivityBorderColor #78909c
}

|#2c3e50|Discovery|
start
:User searches "IELTS practice online"
or sees social media ad;
note right
  **Touchpoints:**
  - Google Search
  - Facebook/TikTok ads
  - Word of mouth
  - IELTS forums
end note

:Lands on **Home Page** (/);
:Sees hero: "Luyen thi IELTS
cung AI thong minh";

|#34495e|Exploration|
:Scrolls through features;
note right
  **Key Value Props:**
  - Authentic Cambridge tests
  - AI Writing grading
  - Progress tracking
  - Affordable pricing
end note

:Views **Pricing Page** (/pricing);
:Compares tiers:
- Cramerie (Free)
- Cramerich (79K/mo)
- Cramerous (149K/mo);

|#1abc9c|Registration|
:Clicks "Bat dau mien phi";
:Redirects to **Login Page** (/login);

if (Has account?) then (yes)
  :Signs in;
else (no)
  :Enters email, password, username;
  :Receives OTP email;
  :Enters 6-digit code;
  :Account created!;
  note right
    **First-time bonus:**
    50 Lua credits
  end note
endif

|#3498db|Onboarding|
:Redirects to **Dashboard** (/dashboard);
:Sees empty state: "Chua co lich su lam bai";
:Prompted to set target band score;
:Sets goal: Band 7.0;

|#9b59b6|First Test Experience|
:Clicks "Bat dau luyen tap";
:Navigates to **Courses** (/courses);
:Browses test sets (Cambridge 15, 16, 17...);
:Selects "Cambridge 17";
:Sees 4 tests available;

:Clicks "Reading Test 1";
:Sees **Start Test Modal**:
- 60 minutes allowed
- 40 questions
- Auto-save enabled;
:Clicks "Bat dau bai thi";

|#e74c3c|Test Taking|
:Timer starts (60:00);
:Reads passage, answers questions;
:Uses highlighting feature;
:Navigates between 3 parts;

fork
  :Auto-saves every 5 min;
fork again
  :Can exit and resume later;
end fork

:Completes all 40 questions;
:Clicks "Nop bai";
:Confirms submission;

|#f39c12|Results & Feedback|
:Redirects to **Review Page**;
:Sees score: 32/40 (Band 7.0);
note right
  **Aha Moment!**
  User sees their actual level
end note

:Reviews wrong answers;
:Sees correct answers with explanations;
:Can retake test anytime;

|#27ae60|Retention|
:Returns to Dashboard;
:Sees first attempt in history;
:Progress chart shows first data point;

:Motivated to try more tests;
:Tries Listening test next;
:Considers Writing test (needs AI grading);

stop

legend right
  **Journey Metrics:**
  |= Stage |= Avg Time |
  | Discovery | 30 sec |
  | Exploration | 2-3 min |
  | Registration | 1-2 min |
  | Onboarding | 1 min |
  | First Test | 45-60 min |
  | Results | 5-10 min |
endlegend

@enduml
